@InventoryOrderManagement.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5237

### Create product
POST {{InventoryOrderManagement.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "KB-001",
  "name": "Mechanical Keyboard",
  "description": "Mechanical keyboard with RGB lighting",
  "currentPrice": 249.90
}

### List products
GET {{InventoryOrderManagement.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products
Accept: application/json

